// Toggle repo agent-runner settings (runners_enabled / auto_run_on_push).
//
// owner/repo-keyed sibling of the legacy UUID-keyed
// `PATCH /repos/:repoId/runner-settings` (api/src/routes/runners.ts), which
// stays in place serving the PlanetScale path until PlanetScale is dropped.
// owner/repo keying lets the dual-write mirror feed resolveCell directly — no
// UUID→ULID bridge. PlanetScale stays authoritative; the entire-api write is a
