**Synchronous hook spawns run without any timeout.** Both sync paths call `Bun.spawnSync` with no upper bound, so a hung or slow `entire` binary blocks OpenCode's event loop indefinitely — while every JSON hook config in this PR caps hooks at 30s.
- `.opencode/plugins/entire.ts#L62-L74`: add `timeout: 30_000` (and `killSignal`) to the `Bun.spawnSync` options in `callHookSync`.
- `.opencode/plugins/entire.ts#L102-L117`: add the same `timeout` to the `Bun.spawnSync` call in `fireTurnStart`, which runs on every user message.

